# Conformance probe pack for spec 0.94: keys of the cases of a switch, and the key it names. Public.
format     conformance-held-case
version    0.94.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
kind    k
when    8  7
field   probe.x  8  uint
switch  probe.x
  case 1
    field  probe.z  8  uint
  case 2
    field  probe.w  8  uint
  else
end
